<main class="wrap inner-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/resources'>Explore MBK</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">directory <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1>Clear steps.<br><em>Thoughtful work.</em><br>Final delivery.</h1><p class="lead">A good project should never feel like a mystery. I’m Bakhtawar Khan, founder of MBK Global. Here’s the practical path we follow to turn your idea into a considered, useful digital result—with clear communication, agreed milestones and a proper handover.</p></section><section class="delivery-hero"><p class="eyebrow">MBK / PROJECT DELIVERY</p></section>
<section class="process-intro"><h2 id="section-1">From “I have an idea” to “It’s ready.”</h2><p>Every project is different, so the exact deliverables and timeline are agreed before work begins. This four-step framework keeps expectations clear and gives you opportunities to review the direction along the way.</p></section>
<section aria-label="Four steps in the project delivery process" class="timeline connected-journey"><article class="step"><div class="step-copy"><span class="step-label">First · Discover</span><h3 id="section-2">We understand your idea.</h3><p>First, we discuss your goals, audience, references, features, deadline and budget. We identify the real problem to solve and define what success should look like.</p><ul><li>Project brief and requirements</li><li>Goals, audience and priorities</li></ul></div><div class="step-number">01</div><div class="step-blank"></div><span class="step-connector"></span></article>
<article class="step"><div class="step-blank"></div><div class="step-number">02</div><div class="step-copy"><span class="step-label">Second · Plan</span><h3 id="section-3">We shape the direction.</h3><p>Next, we turn the brief into a practical plan. Depending on the project, this may include page structure, a visual direction, a feature list, milestones and a delivery schedule.</p><ul><li>Scope and milestones agreed</li><li>Design direction or technical plan</li></ul></div><span class="step-connector"></span></article>
<article class="step"><div class="step-copy"><span class="step-label">Third · Build &amp; review</span><h3 id="section-4">We create, test and refine.</h3><p>Then the design or development work begins. You can review agreed checkpoints, share feedback and help us refine the details before final delivery.</p><ul><li>Build, integration and quality checks</li><li>Feedback and agreed revisions</li></ul></div><div class="step-number">03</div><div class="step-blank"></div><span class="step-connector"></span></article>
<article class="step"><div class="step-blank"></div><div class="step-number">04</div><div class="step-copy"><span class="step-label">Finally · Deliver</span><h3 id="section-5">Your final project is handed over.</h3><p>Finally, we review the agreed deliverables and hand over the finished work. Depending on the scope, this can include source files, deployment assistance, documentation and guidance for what comes next.</p><ul><li>Final review against the brief</li><li>Handover and next-step guidance</li></ul></div></article></section>
<section class="delivery-final"><p class="eyebrow">THE FINISH LINE IS A HANDOVER</p><h2 id="section-6">Built with purpose.<br>Delivered with clarity.</h2><p>Our goal is not just to finish a task, but to give you a result you understand and can move forward with. The final scope, payment stages, revisions, third-party fees and ongoing support are agreed in writing before work starts—so there are no hidden assumptions.</p><a href='/services'>Explore services ↗</a><a href='/contact'>Start your project ↗</a><a href="https://wa.me/923200276941" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">Chat on WhatsApp ↗</a></section>
